\date{2025-11-14T19:38:12Z}
\title{Top-level typing judgment}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{The top-level typing judgment is of the form ##{\swtop{\Gamma}{t}{\sigma}} which simply says that term #{t} has [polytype](001N) #{\sigma} in context #{\Gamma}. Here #{\Gamma} is a type context associating variables with their types. The polytype #{\sigma} quantifies over type and capability variables, and contains a set of capbilities needed to evaluate the term #{t}.}
